{
  "mailer_subjects_confirmation": "Confirm your email address",
  "mailer_templates_confirmation_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f8f7f4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1b1b1b;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Confirm your email address to finish setting up your Empowr Members account.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f8f7f4;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e1db;\">\n<!-- The white logo, straight onto the blue bar, nothing behind it.\n     /logo-white.png is the official white variant (_brand/logos/\n     empowr-logo-transparent.png) — NOT a recoloured logo.png, which the\n     brand guide forbids. It gives 4.78:1 against brand blue; the navy\n     master gives 2.33:1, which is why this used to sit in a white chip.\n     The chip was a workaround for an asset that already existed.\n     No wordmark text beside it: the logo already contains \"Empowr\", so a\n     separate \"Empowr CIC\" span rendered the name twice.\n     Centred per the user's request (2026-08-29) — email-only, this does\n     NOT apply to the on-screen site headers (SiteHeader/AdminHeader),\n     which stay left-aligned. text-align on the td plus margin:0 auto on\n     the img, since the img is display:block for Outlook and won't centre\n     from text-align alone.\n     Absolute URL because email clients cannot resolve relative paths, and\n     alt text carries the brand for the many clients that block remote\n     images by default. Explicit width/height attributes (not just CSS)\n     are what Outlook actually honours. -->\n<tr><td style=\"background:#4a70c2;padding:20px 28px;text-align:center;\">\n<img src=\"https://members.empowrcic.org/logo-white.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Empowr CIC\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;width:80px;height:80px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px 28px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#3558a8;\">Confirm your email address</h1>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4a4a;\">\nWelcome to Empowr CIC. Confirm your email address to finish setting up your account — then you can book sessions, add the people in your household, and pull up your tickets at the door.\n</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0;\">\n<tr><td style=\"border-radius:999px;background:#4a70c2;\">\n<a href=\"{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=signup\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;\">Confirm email address</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nButton not working? Copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>\n<a href=\"{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=signup\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;word-break:break-all;\">{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=signup</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nThis link expires in one hour. If you did not create an Empowr Members account, you can safely ignore this email.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 28px 28px 28px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nEmpowr CIC · <a href=\"https://empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">empowrcic.org</a><br>\nQuestions? Reply to this email or contact <a href=\"mailto:general@empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">general@empowrcic.org</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "mailer_subjects_magic_link": "Your sign-in link",
  "mailer_templates_magic_link_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f8f7f4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1b1b1b;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Your single-use link to sign in to Empowr Members.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f8f7f4;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e1db;\">\n<!-- The white logo, straight onto the blue bar, nothing behind it.\n     /logo-white.png is the official white variant (_brand/logos/\n     empowr-logo-transparent.png) — NOT a recoloured logo.png, which the\n     brand guide forbids. It gives 4.78:1 against brand blue; the navy\n     master gives 2.33:1, which is why this used to sit in a white chip.\n     The chip was a workaround for an asset that already existed.\n     No wordmark text beside it: the logo already contains \"Empowr\", so a\n     separate \"Empowr CIC\" span rendered the name twice.\n     Centred per the user's request (2026-08-29) — email-only, this does\n     NOT apply to the on-screen site headers (SiteHeader/AdminHeader),\n     which stay left-aligned. text-align on the td plus margin:0 auto on\n     the img, since the img is display:block for Outlook and won't centre\n     from text-align alone.\n     Absolute URL because email clients cannot resolve relative paths, and\n     alt text carries the brand for the many clients that block remote\n     images by default. Explicit width/height attributes (not just CSS)\n     are what Outlook actually honours. -->\n<tr><td style=\"background:#4a70c2;padding:20px 28px;text-align:center;\">\n<img src=\"https://members.empowrcic.org/logo-white.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Empowr CIC\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;width:80px;height:80px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px 28px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#3558a8;\">Your sign-in link</h1>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4a4a;\">\nHere is your link to sign in to Empowr Members. No password needed — just tap the button.\n</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0;\">\n<tr><td style=\"border-radius:999px;background:#4a70c2;\">\n<a href=\"{{ .RedirectTo }}&token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=magiclink\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;\">Sign in</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nButton not working? Copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>\n<a href=\"{{ .RedirectTo }}&token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=magiclink\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;word-break:break-all;\">{{ .RedirectTo }}&token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=magiclink</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nThis link expires in one hour and can only be used once. If you did not ask to sign in, you can ignore this email — the link is the only way in, so your account stays secure.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 28px 28px 28px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nEmpowr CIC · <a href=\"https://empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">empowrcic.org</a><br>\nQuestions? Reply to this email or contact <a href=\"mailto:general@empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">general@empowrcic.org</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "mailer_subjects_recovery": "Choose a new password",
  "mailer_templates_recovery_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f8f7f4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1b1b1b;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">A single-use link to set a new password on your account.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f8f7f4;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e1db;\">\n<!-- The white logo, straight onto the blue bar, nothing behind it.\n     /logo-white.png is the official white variant (_brand/logos/\n     empowr-logo-transparent.png) — NOT a recoloured logo.png, which the\n     brand guide forbids. It gives 4.78:1 against brand blue; the navy\n     master gives 2.33:1, which is why this used to sit in a white chip.\n     The chip was a workaround for an asset that already existed.\n     No wordmark text beside it: the logo already contains \"Empowr\", so a\n     separate \"Empowr CIC\" span rendered the name twice.\n     Centred per the user's request (2026-08-29) — email-only, this does\n     NOT apply to the on-screen site headers (SiteHeader/AdminHeader),\n     which stay left-aligned. text-align on the td plus margin:0 auto on\n     the img, since the img is display:block for Outlook and won't centre\n     from text-align alone.\n     Absolute URL because email clients cannot resolve relative paths, and\n     alt text carries the brand for the many clients that block remote\n     images by default. Explicit width/height attributes (not just CSS)\n     are what Outlook actually honours. -->\n<tr><td style=\"background:#4a70c2;padding:20px 28px;text-align:center;\">\n<img src=\"https://members.empowrcic.org/logo-white.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Empowr CIC\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;width:80px;height:80px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px 28px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#3558a8;\">Choose a new password</h1>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4a4a;\">\nUse the link below to choose a new password for your Empowr Members account.\n</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0;\">\n<tr><td style=\"border-radius:999px;background:#4a70c2;\">\n<a href=\"{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=recovery&next=/account/password\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;\">Choose a new password</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nButton not working? Copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>\n<a href=\"{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=recovery&next=/account/password\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;word-break:break-all;\">{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=recovery&next=/account/password</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nThis link expires in one hour and can only be used once. If you did not ask to reset your password, you can safely ignore this email — your current password stays as it is. Need help getting into your account? Just reply and we will sort it out.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 28px 28px 28px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nEmpowr CIC · <a href=\"https://empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">empowrcic.org</a><br>\nQuestions? Reply to this email or contact <a href=\"mailto:general@empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">general@empowrcic.org</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "mailer_subjects_email_change": "Confirm your new email address",
  "mailer_templates_email_change_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f8f7f4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1b1b1b;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Confirm the email address change on your Empowr Members account.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f8f7f4;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e1db;\">\n<!-- The white logo, straight onto the blue bar, nothing behind it.\n     /logo-white.png is the official white variant (_brand/logos/\n     empowr-logo-transparent.png) — NOT a recoloured logo.png, which the\n     brand guide forbids. It gives 4.78:1 against brand blue; the navy\n     master gives 2.33:1, which is why this used to sit in a white chip.\n     The chip was a workaround for an asset that already existed.\n     No wordmark text beside it: the logo already contains \"Empowr\", so a\n     separate \"Empowr CIC\" span rendered the name twice.\n     Centred per the user's request (2026-08-29) — email-only, this does\n     NOT apply to the on-screen site headers (SiteHeader/AdminHeader),\n     which stay left-aligned. text-align on the td plus margin:0 auto on\n     the img, since the img is display:block for Outlook and won't centre\n     from text-align alone.\n     Absolute URL because email clients cannot resolve relative paths, and\n     alt text carries the brand for the many clients that block remote\n     images by default. Explicit width/height attributes (not just CSS)\n     are what Outlook actually honours. -->\n<tr><td style=\"background:#4a70c2;padding:20px 28px;text-align:center;\">\n<img src=\"https://members.empowrcic.org/logo-white.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Empowr CIC\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;width:80px;height:80px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px 28px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#3558a8;\">Confirm your email change</h1>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4a4a;\">\nWe were asked to change the email address on your Empowr Members account to <strong style=\"color:#1b1b1b;\">{{ .NewEmail }}</strong>.\n</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0;\">\n<tr><td style=\"border-radius:999px;background:#4a70c2;\">\n<a href=\"{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=email_change\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;\">Confirm this change</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nButton not working? Copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>\n<a href=\"{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=email_change\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;word-break:break-all;\">{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=email_change</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nFor your security both the old and the new address have to confirm before the change takes effect, so you may get this email twice. If you did not request this change, ignore this email and the address on your account stays as it is.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 28px 28px 28px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nEmpowr CIC · <a href=\"https://empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">empowrcic.org</a><br>\nQuestions? Reply to this email or contact <a href=\"mailto:general@empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">general@empowrcic.org</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "mailer_subjects_invite": "You have been invited to Empowr Members",
  "mailer_templates_invite_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f8f7f4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1b1b1b;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">You have been invited to create an Empowr Members account.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f8f7f4;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e1db;\">\n<!-- The white logo, straight onto the blue bar, nothing behind it.\n     /logo-white.png is the official white variant (_brand/logos/\n     empowr-logo-transparent.png) — NOT a recoloured logo.png, which the\n     brand guide forbids. It gives 4.78:1 against brand blue; the navy\n     master gives 2.33:1, which is why this used to sit in a white chip.\n     The chip was a workaround for an asset that already existed.\n     No wordmark text beside it: the logo already contains \"Empowr\", so a\n     separate \"Empowr CIC\" span rendered the name twice.\n     Centred per the user's request (2026-08-29) — email-only, this does\n     NOT apply to the on-screen site headers (SiteHeader/AdminHeader),\n     which stay left-aligned. text-align on the td plus margin:0 auto on\n     the img, since the img is display:block for Outlook and won't centre\n     from text-align alone.\n     Absolute URL because email clients cannot resolve relative paths, and\n     alt text carries the brand for the many clients that block remote\n     images by default. Explicit width/height attributes (not just CSS)\n     are what Outlook actually honours. -->\n<tr><td style=\"background:#4a70c2;padding:20px 28px;text-align:center;\">\n<img src=\"https://members.empowrcic.org/logo-white.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Empowr CIC\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;width:80px;height:80px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px 28px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#3558a8;\">You have been invited</h1>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4a4a;\">\nYou have been invited to create an Empowr Members account. That is where you book Empowr CIC sessions, manage the people in your household, and get your tickets.\n</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0;\">\n<tr><td style=\"border-radius:999px;background:#4a70c2;\">\n<a href=\"{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=invite\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;\">Accept invitation</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nButton not working? Copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>\n<a href=\"{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=invite\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;word-break:break-all;\">{{ .SiteURL }}/auth/confirm/start?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=invite</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nIf you were not expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 28px 28px 28px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nEmpowr CIC · <a href=\"https://empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">empowrcic.org</a><br>\nQuestions? Reply to this email or contact <a href=\"mailto:general@empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">general@empowrcic.org</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "mailer_subjects_reauthentication": "Your Empowr Members verification code",
  "mailer_templates_reauthentication_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f8f7f4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1b1b1b;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Your verification code for Empowr Members.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f8f7f4;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e1db;\">\n<!-- The white logo, straight onto the blue bar, nothing behind it.\n     /logo-white.png is the official white variant (_brand/logos/\n     empowr-logo-transparent.png) — NOT a recoloured logo.png, which the\n     brand guide forbids. It gives 4.78:1 against brand blue; the navy\n     master gives 2.33:1, which is why this used to sit in a white chip.\n     The chip was a workaround for an asset that already existed.\n     No wordmark text beside it: the logo already contains \"Empowr\", so a\n     separate \"Empowr CIC\" span rendered the name twice.\n     Centred per the user's request (2026-08-29) — email-only, this does\n     NOT apply to the on-screen site headers (SiteHeader/AdminHeader),\n     which stay left-aligned. text-align on the td plus margin:0 auto on\n     the img, since the img is display:block for Outlook and won't centre\n     from text-align alone.\n     Absolute URL because email clients cannot resolve relative paths, and\n     alt text carries the brand for the many clients that block remote\n     images by default. Explicit width/height attributes (not just CSS)\n     are what Outlook actually honours. -->\n<tr><td style=\"background:#4a70c2;padding:20px 28px;text-align:center;\">\n<img src=\"https://members.empowrcic.org/logo-white.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Empowr CIC\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;width:80px;height:80px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px 28px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#3558a8;\">Your verification code</h1>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a4a4a;\">\nEnter this code to confirm it is really you.\n</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#eef3fc;border-radius:12px;margin:4px 0 16px 0;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:16px 20px;\"><div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.22em;color:#3558a8;text-align:center;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;\">{{ .Token }}</div></td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nThe code expires in one hour. If you did not request it, you can safely ignore this email — and please reply to let us know.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 28px 28px 28px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a7a8a;\">\nEmpowr CIC · <a href=\"https://empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">empowrcic.org</a><br>\nQuestions? Reply to this email or contact <a href=\"mailto:general@empowrcic.org\" style=\"color:#4a70c2;text-decoration:none;\">general@empowrcic.org</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>"
}